		"description": "Postman collection for Omni-CFO Multi-Tenant File Ingestion API.\n\nPre-seeded Tenant IDs:\n- Acme Retail Enterprises: `a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001`\n- Nova Logistics & Transport: `b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002`",
